WEBVTT

00:10.510 --> 00:11.760
<b>There’re so many of them!</b>

00:15.680 --> 00:16.680
<b>Now or never!</b>

00:17.550 --> 00:18.390
<b>Stop!</b>

00:24.810 --> 00:25.650
<b>Hank!</b>

00:38.070 --> 00:40.200
<b>Everything rests
on decoding Sarah’s signals.</b>

00:40.700 --> 00:41.540
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

00:48.500 --> 00:49.340
<b>Go!</b>

00:54.800 --> 00:59.430
<b><i>Field operations commencing.</i>
<i>Time to move, Agent.</i></b>

02:35.070 --> 02:36.280
<b>You should see the other guy.</b>

02:36.900 --> 02:38.780
<b>Hank. I owe you one.</b>

02:40.280 --> 02:41.570
<b>Are you able to flash forward?</b>

02:44.280 --> 02:46.660
<b>No good.
I can’t do anything on Enlightened turf.</b>

02:48.120 --> 02:50.790
<b>We won’t last here.
Let’s regroup with the others.</b>

03:05.810 --> 03:06.680
<b>We’re in bad shape.</b>

03:07.680 --> 03:08.680
<b>How’re things looking?</b>

03:09.560 --> 03:12.900
<b>Pretty rough.
Best we can do is dig in and...</b>

03:20.610 --> 03:22.860
<b>They’re gonna collapse
the whole damn cave!</b>

03:24.370 --> 03:26.370
<b>Everyone, fall back! Take cover inside!</b>

03:28.790 --> 03:30.500
<b>We will rise with flesh immortal!</b>

03:40.840 --> 03:41.670
<b>Hold on!</b>

03:42.760 --> 03:44.840
<b>A place this old’s gotta have secrets.</b>

04:12.120 --> 04:13.120
<b>This kid struck gold.</b>

04:16.790 --> 04:17.750
<b>The hell?</b>

04:17.840 --> 04:18.710
<b>Shut up and help!</b>

04:21.920 --> 04:22.920
<b>Fire!</b>

04:30.680 --> 04:32.140
<b>Mission parameters achieved.</b>

04:44.780 --> 04:46.320
<b>What the hell is this place?</b>

04:47.530 --> 04:50.030
<b>A structure of indeterminate origin.</b>

04:51.120 --> 04:55.370
<b>Unknown to even the Azmati.
Or perhaps forgotten.</b>

04:57.040 --> 04:58.540
<b>We are in your debt.</b>

04:59.670 --> 05:02.090
<b>Not me. Thank him.</b>

05:12.930 --> 05:15.690
<b>The exit’s up ahead. Let's go.</b>

05:44.590 --> 05:49.010
<b>I’ve been in firefights on each continent,
but never seen people like that.</b>

05:50.260 --> 05:53.510
<b>They fought like they were
possessed by something.</b>

05:54.640 --> 05:55.890
<b>The Collaborators.</b>

05:56.730 --> 05:57.770
<b>The Collaborators?</b>

05:58.900 --> 06:00.480
<b>Hulong. SE.</b>

06:01.310 --> 06:04.150
<b>Two tiny pieces of
something bigger and worse.</b>

06:05.070 --> 06:07.530
<b>Each one empowers the other,</b>

06:08.910 --> 06:10.870
<b>and they’re wired in everywhere.</b>

06:11.660 --> 06:13.830
<b>XM tech. Arms manufacturing.</b>

06:14.490 --> 06:16.410
<b>Police. Politics. Military.</b>

06:17.040 --> 06:19.830
<b>They sit on company boards,
or in government chambers,</b>

06:19.920 --> 06:22.130
<b>using what power they have
to gain more.</b>

06:22.880 --> 06:25.250
<b>I call them “Collaborators.”</b>

06:27.050 --> 06:29.010
<b>So you’re saying Liu is one of them?</b>

06:29.760 --> 06:33.930
<b>I don’t know who that is.
But I wouldn’t focus on the individuals.</b>

06:35.010 --> 06:37.730
<b>Study their methods and motives.</b>

06:39.060 --> 06:44.440
<b>I don’t know what it is,
but there’s a reason you're here.</b>

06:45.690 --> 06:49.610
<b>When you were captured by the Azmati,
you covered for one another.</b>

06:51.360 --> 06:52.820
<b>That caught my interest.</b>

06:54.780 --> 06:58.580
<b>I wondered why two opposing Agents
would work so closely.</b>

07:00.000 --> 07:03.880
<b>And then you saved our lives,
leading us through a forgotten structure.</b>

07:05.750 --> 07:09.260
<b>We’ll pick up the pieces here.
You two need to get to Switzerland.</b>

07:09.920 --> 07:10.760
<b>Are you sure?</b>

07:11.010 --> 07:15.300
<b>I’ve got a hunch you two
have a bigger mission to fulfill.</b>

07:23.900 --> 07:27.900
<b>I’ll pull strings to get you a ride.
That'll get you on your way.</b>

07:31.150 --> 07:31.990
<b>What's wrong?</b>

07:32.860 --> 07:34.910
<b>It's just... something doesn't feel right.</b>

07:36.580 --> 07:42.330
<b>If they want to milk this conflict
for profit, why nearly wipe out one side?</b>

07:43.120 --> 07:46.420
<b>They can't play their game without
both teams up and running.</b>

07:47.710 --> 07:48.590
<b>That’s true.</b>

07:49.670 --> 07:54.140
<b>A Dark XM mine and some money?
That can’t be their endgame.</b>

07:55.680 --> 07:57.140
<b>No. It doesn’t add up.</b>

08:05.230 --> 08:06.060
<b>Antoine Smith here.</b>

08:07.020 --> 08:11.820
<b><i>These targets were seen in the operation.</i>
<i>Have you recovered their bodies?</i></b>

08:13.700 --> 08:16.160
<b><i>It is imperative those two are dead.</i></b>

08:18.450 --> 08:22.000
<b>SE had only one objective: Dark XM.</b>

08:22.710 --> 08:27.130
<b>You know the Azmati will defend this place
to the bitter end. And beyond.</b>

08:27.750 --> 08:29.960
<b>I won’t jeopardize operations
for your hit job.</b>

08:40.810 --> 08:43.600
<b><i>It’s much more than personal.</i></b>

08:44.190 --> 08:48.900
<b><i>They’re working with the Azmati.</i>
<i>Obstructing our destiny.</i></b>

08:51.030 --> 08:53.740
<b><i>If they escape,</i>
<i>your tiny mission will be lost.</i></b>

08:54.360 --> 08:56.240
<b><i>Find them, and dispose of them.</i></b>

08:58.410 --> 08:59.280
<b>Understood.</b>

09:30.150 --> 09:31.480
<b>Dark XM?</b>

09:33.320 --> 09:35.110
<b>What are you hiding?</b>

09:39.160 --> 09:40.830
<b>This’ll get you to the airstrip.</b>

09:41.910 --> 09:44.660
<b>She might not be the prettiest,
but she’ll do.</b>

09:45.660 --> 09:47.040
<b>Time to hit the road.</b>

10:08.520 --> 10:09.350
<b>Hank.</b>

10:10.190 --> 10:14.030
<b>You said Dark XM affects the mind
and body. Tell me more.</b>

10:16.530 --> 10:21.740
<b>It affects people’s cells, synapses...
even their genetic coding.</b>

10:23.330 --> 10:28.370
<b>Had the Niantic Project gone as planned,
maybe we would know more.</b>

10:29.670 --> 10:31.290
<b>Jack mentioned that project.</b>

10:32.880 --> 10:38.800
<b>At CERN, we discovered that a signal in XM
alters the human brain.</b>

10:40.220 --> 10:45.930
<b>But Dark XM has more volatile properties.
Physical ones. It can lead to death.</b>

10:46.770 --> 10:50.350
<b>And I can only speculate
on its more extreme effects.</b>

10:51.230 --> 10:52.440
<b>More extreme than death?</b>

10:53.150 --> 10:57.900
<b>Dark XM’s a black hole.
Nobody knows where its power ends.</b>

10:58.740 --> 11:01.950
<b>But I have a bad feeling
Hulong knows more than any of us.</b>

11:08.700 --> 11:09.540
<b>Yeah.</b>

11:10.290 --> 11:13.380
<b>Even worse. They’re actively using it.</b>

11:14.000 --> 11:14.840
<b>What?!</b>

11:15.460 --> 11:18.170
<b>The lab in Kyoto, the battle here...</b>

11:18.670 --> 11:21.130
<b>I think they’re both part
of the Collaborators’ plan.</b>

11:23.090 --> 11:26.430
<b>They've been researching
emotional manipulation and control.</b>

11:27.600 --> 11:30.890
<b>And they’re incorporating Dark XM
into these visors</b>

11:31.190 --> 11:34.770
<b>to make the effect on their soldiers
"more extreme," as Hank put it.</b>

11:37.480 --> 11:39.320
<b>The Signals... Glyphs...</b>

11:41.610 --> 11:42.780
<b>Now it makes sense.</b>

11:43.410 --> 11:44.490
<b>Sarah’s ability.</b>

11:45.830 --> 11:49.410
<b>The power to communicate
through the Portal network.</b>

11:52.250 --> 11:55.380
<b>I’m sure that’s why they kidnapped her.</b>

12:00.050 --> 12:05.510
<b>Early Resistance scientists discovered
that XM has an effect on the brain.</b>

12:06.550 --> 12:10.390
<b>They called it a "Shaper Mind Virus,"
blinding themselves to its potential.</b>

12:11.850 --> 12:15.190
<b>Their understanding of how XM works
on the brain was flawed.</b>

12:15.940 --> 12:17.690
<b>As research continued,</b>

12:17.770 --> 12:21.490
<b>they learned that Glyphs were the key
to shaping a mind.</b>

12:22.450 --> 12:28.530
<b>Glyphs are control embodied.
A universal language influencing the mind.</b>

12:29.450 --> 12:34.870
<b>You didn't know you could channel Glyphs,
but we did.</b>

12:34.960 --> 12:38.630
<b>We also knew you could send thoughts
through the Portals.</b>

12:39.750 --> 12:44.180
<b>But we needed to know how.
The project hinged on it.</b>

12:44.970 --> 12:48.890
<b>From Glyph to idea to XM signal,
you've shown us every piece.</b>

12:50.010 --> 12:52.520
<b>You're my perfect Rosetta Stone.</b>

12:53.730 --> 12:54.640
<b>Oh...</b>

12:54.890 --> 12:58.440
<b>And those messages you sent your friends?</b>

12:58.520 --> 13:01.190
<b>We intercepted every last one of them.</b>

13:01.780 --> 13:05.700
<b>You’ve been so useful to us,
and will continue to be.</b>

13:06.450 --> 13:10.240
<b>Let me thank you personally
my dear, sweet...</b>

13:11.790 --> 13:12.620
<b>Sarah.</b>

13:15.210 --> 13:18.170
<b>So these are basically signal amplifiers.</b>

13:18.880 --> 13:22.250
<b>I’m assuming the effects of the Glyphs
were too subtle alone?</b>

13:23.130 --> 13:27.220
<b>Mix in Dark XM and you’ve got
a recipe for disaster on steroids.</b>

13:28.180 --> 13:32.850
<b>Hulong needed lots of Dark XM,
but the Azmati stood strong.</b>

13:33.470 --> 13:36.810
<b>They needed to use mind control
on their mercs to kill them all off.</b>

13:42.940 --> 13:43.780
<b>Incoming!</b>

13:44.860 --> 13:45.690
<b>Hang on!</b>

14:15.180 --> 14:16.680
<b>Eliminate the two key targets.</b>

14:20.940 --> 14:23.230
<b>Those visors are doing their job.
Can’t shake ‘em.</b>

14:23.690 --> 14:25.730
<b>Do they know they’re being manipulated?</b>

14:26.190 --> 14:27.950
<b>I wouldn’t bet on it, kid!</b>

14:34.620 --> 14:37.580
<b>Outnumbered again? Gimme a break!</b>

14:42.880 --> 14:43.710
<b>Hard right!</b>

14:54.600 --> 14:57.680
<b>Barricade every route!
No escape!</b>

14:58.060 --> 14:59.270
<b>-Roger.
<i>-Roger.</i></b>

15:17.580 --> 15:19.290
<b>No way out.</b>

15:20.710 --> 15:23.040
<b>I’ll distract them. You two bail.</b>

15:24.380 --> 15:28.050
<b>Roll out when we reach the woods.
The airstrip’s due west.</b>

15:28.420 --> 15:29.550
<b>But what about you?</b>

15:29.840 --> 15:32.470
<b>I’ll be fine.
They’ll go through a hell of a lot worse.</b>

15:33.970 --> 15:38.850
<b>We all have critical parts to play.
Remember what you saw here!</b>

15:42.940 --> 15:46.110
<b>Good luck charm.
Unlocked the right doors for me.</b>

15:48.190 --> 15:49.030
<b>Hank...</b>

15:56.490 --> 15:57.330
<b>Now go!</b>

16:23.390 --> 16:27.520
<b>Jahan, sorry I had to pass along
that family heirloom...</b>

16:27.610 --> 16:30.280
<b>But I suspect those two will need it.</b>

16:50.960 --> 16:53.720
<b>And I’m not sure I need it for this!</b>

17:16.530 --> 17:17.820
<b>Stupid bunch of fools.</b>

17:19.320 --> 17:21.700
<b>That stupidity has allowed them
to survive!</b>

17:22.410 --> 17:25.710
<b>They are Sensitives!
They're not like you knuckle-draggers!</b>

17:26.290 --> 17:28.210
<b>We have to assume they’re still alive.</b>

17:30.170 --> 17:33.670
<b>Get a security detail around the facility.
Spare no expense.</b>

17:33.760 --> 17:34.590
<b>Yes sir!</b>

17:39.930 --> 17:44.390
<b>You’ll lose...
because you underestimated them.</b>

17:49.480 --> 17:53.730
<b>They got the better of me, I’ll admit.
But this isn’t over yet.</b>

17:54.740 --> 17:58.280
<b>Still, what a shame to waste
such extraordinary Sensitives.</b>

17:59.450 --> 18:00.820
<b>How far...</b>

18:01.870 --> 18:08.250
<b>To the end of the line, wherever that is.
That is the path I’m carving.</b>

18:09.710 --> 18:11.670
<b>We’re a lot alike, you know?</b>

18:12.290 --> 18:15.590
<b>Just like you, I’ve had to suffer
for my abilities.</b>

18:16.220 --> 18:17.930
<b>People fear greatness.</b>

18:18.800 --> 18:23.680
<b>We carry our gifts like a curse.</b>

18:25.810 --> 18:30.400
<b>Society shuns genius,
and lionizes the mediocre.</b>

18:31.190 --> 18:35.730
<b>In order to fix that,
we have to change the world itself.</b>

18:37.650 --> 18:42.280
<b>Mankind is scattered.
Drifting. So aimless.</b>

18:43.330 --> 18:45.120
<b>And it holds us all back.</b>

18:46.580 --> 18:50.120
<b>What it needs is leadership
from those who have a vision,</b>

18:50.210 --> 18:52.670
<b>and the power to execute it.</b>

18:53.750 --> 18:56.590
<b>People just like you and me, Sarah.</b>

18:58.010 --> 19:01.760
<b>We could shape the future.
Just the two of us.</b>

19:18.690 --> 19:19.530
<b>He’s gone.</b>

19:20.320 --> 19:21.990
<b>We owe it to him to keep going.</b>

19:23.820 --> 19:25.490
<b>We can’t let his death be in vain.</b>

19:27.450 --> 19:31.330
<b>It’s gonna get ugly in Switzerland.
Rest up on the plane.</b>

19:31.920 --> 19:35.090
<b>Your visor... is it the same one
the mercs were wearing?</b>

19:36.130 --> 19:37.500
<b>It’s an older prototype.</b>

19:38.210 --> 19:40.010
<b>It can't be used to hack your brain?</b>

19:40.760 --> 19:41.590
<b>Won’t happen.</b>

19:42.720 --> 19:44.260
<b>Brandt made this one personally.</b>

19:47.100 --> 19:50.520
<b>I told you before that Brandt
worked with Hulong, remember?</b>

19:52.310 --> 19:56.440
<b>They asked him to design a new type
of augmented reality visor.</b>

19:57.440 --> 19:59.740
<b>One that could send a signal
straight to the optic nerve.</b>

20:00.400 --> 20:02.320
<b>Even allow the blind to see.</b>

20:03.860 --> 20:07.160
<b>But before he could finish it,
they pulled him off the project.</b>

20:08.290 --> 20:10.080
<b>Until just now, I didn’t know why.</b>

20:11.500 --> 20:12.410
<b>Do you think...</b>

20:13.670 --> 20:15.040
<b>He tried to stop it.</b>

20:15.790 --> 20:19.960
<b>Brandt wanted to push humanity forward.
He wouldn’t stand for mind control.</b>

20:20.630 --> 20:24.130
<b>Something just doesn’t add up here.
Sure, they’ve got some super-mercs...</b>

20:24.720 --> 20:26.140
<b>But why go to all the trouble?</b>

20:26.470 --> 20:29.640
<b>It’s more than mercs.
They’re after something much bigger.</b>

20:31.600 --> 20:33.270
<b>Didn’t you see all the ads?</b>

20:34.390 --> 20:36.060
<b>They were everywhere in Japan.</b>

20:39.650 --> 20:43.610
<b>Hulong’s launching a new
AR visor worldwide.</b>

20:44.240 --> 20:47.160
<b>Every consumer in the world.
How’s that for a Collaborator agenda?</b>

20:48.450 --> 20:49.580
<b>And they go on sale...</b>

20:50.160 --> 20:50.990
<b>Tomorrow!</b>

20:51.790 --> 20:52.910
<b>Millions.</b>

20:53.000 --> 20:56.460
<b>No. Tens of millions opening their minds
to the highest bidder.</b>

20:57.790 --> 20:59.960
<b>We’re on a deadline. Let’s go!</b>

22:53.830 --> 22:55.830
<b>Subtitle Translation by Rika Takahashi</b>
